OL,3,AUS Supreme Court allows execution of
OL,4,AChrista Pike to go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Supreme Court has cleared the
OL,7,Fway for Tennessee inmate Christa Pike
OL,8,Fto be executed, overturning a
OL,9,Flast-minute reprieve.
OL,11,FThe killing by lethal injection was
OL,12,Fscheduled for Wednesday morning before
OL,13,Fjudges from the Sixth Circuit Appeals
OL,14,Fcourt halted the execution. Tennessee's
OL,15,Fattorney general then immediately
OL,16,Frequested the Supreme Court to overrule
OL,17,Fthe lower court's stay.
OL,19,FPike, 50, has been awaiting execution
OL,20,Fsince she was convicted and sentenced
OL,21,Fto death in 1996 for the murder of
OL,22,FColleen Slemmer.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
