OL,3,AUS Supreme Court allows execution of
OL,4,AChrista Pike to go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf the execution proceeds, Christa Pike
OL,7,Fwill be the first woman to be executed
OL,8,Fin Tennessee in more than 200 years. It
OL,9,Fwas not immediately clear when the
OL,10,Fexecution would take place.
